## Business Description

SecureCloud Technologies provides cloud-based HR, payroll, attendance, and employee management software to organizations worldwide.

The company is implementing ISO/IEC 27001:2022 and preparing for SOC 2 Type II certification to strengthen its information security and compliance posture.

